      "message": "Tested on macan (OnePlus 15R, CPH2769), which uses icnss2:\n\n- Before: DMS MAC received as 3b:70:26:bc:ed:78 (multicast bit set),\n  cnss_utils reported \"WLAN MAC address is not set\" and the device\n  ended up with a placeholder MAC (00:12:4a:61:bf:9b).\n- After: \"Received DMS MAC: [78:ed:bc:26:70:3b]\", which is BT MAC + 1\n  as on stock, and Android stores it as wifi_sta_factory_mac_address.\n\nSame approach as 504266/504265 for cnss2.",
